SUMMARY:Storytime on the Roof with Durham County Library
DESCRIPTION:Summer’s here\, and Storytime on the Roof returns! Durham County Library brings their beloved interactive storytime to The Roof\, complete with books\, music\, movement\, and smiles. \nGrab a pastry\, juice\, or a cold brew from our first-floor Coffee Bar before heading up. \nFree and open to all ages. Storytime starts at 10:30 AM.
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/storytime-on-the-roof-with-durham-county-library-2/2026-06-15/
LOCATION:The Durham Hotel\, 315 E Chapel Hill Street\, Durham\, NC\, 27701\, United States
CATEGORIES:Free
