SUMMARY:Flow Forward
DESCRIPTION:Flow Forward is a donation-based community wellness experience centered around movement\, connection\, and giving back. Join us for an intentional evening of guided all-levels yoga\, mindfulness\, and community care at Durham Central Park Pavilion. \nGuests are encouraged to bring menstrual hygiene products and self-care essentials supporting local organizations serving women in Durham. \nJune 18\, 2026\n6:30 PM – 8:30 PM\nCheck-In Begins at 6:15 PM \nCurated by Gabrielle Prince\nYoga led by @ms.twistedyogi
